# Local Worker secrets for `wrangler dev` / `opennextjs-cloudflare preview`.
# Copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored); never commit a value.
#
# In stage/prod these three are Worker secrets, not wrangler vars: the deploy
# lane sets SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY from the orun secret the `supabase` root
# publishes, and the product sets the two Stripe values once per environment
# (`wrangler secret put STRIPE_SECRET_KEY` / `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET` on the
# `subscription-payments-web-<env>` Worker, or as orun secrets the deploy lane
# reads). See specs/epics/subscription-payments/design.md.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# The Supabase URL and anon key are wrangler vars (rendered into
# wrangler.jsonc from wiring.fixture.json by `pnpm run wire:fixture`); put
# real values here only to point a local Worker at a real project.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
